    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "T J Gavigan are delighted to present to the summer market this unique countryside property located in the peaceful and highly sought-after area of Curraghtown, Navan, just off the Commons Road. Set on mature landscaped grounds and surrounded by open countryside, this attractive detached residence offers an excellent blend of comfortable family living, additional self-contained accommodation and substantial outbuildings, all within easy reach of Navan Town and the M3 motorway network.\n\nApproached via a sweeping gravel driveway, the property enjoys a private setting with mature hedging, established trees and beautifully maintained gardens. The residence is complemented by a detached one-bedroom apartment and an impressive detached garage/workshop, making it an ideal opportunity for families seeking additional accommodation, a home office, hobby space or potential rental income (subject to any necessary consents).\n\nCurraghtown off the main Commons Road is a well-regarded rural location approximately 6km from Navan Town Centre, offering the perfect balance between country living and modern convenience, with easy access to schools, local amenities and commuter routes to Dublin. \n\nAccommodation Schedule - Main House\nThis home extends to approximately 110 sq.m., a traditional style bungalow layout laid out to provide bright and spacious living accommodation throughout.\n\nA welcoming entrance hall leads to a comfortable sitting room overlooking the front gardens. The heart of the home is the spacious kitchen/dining area, which connects seamlessly to a bright garden room, creating an ideal space for everyday family living and entertaining. Off the kitchen is a large utility room with access to the back of the house. \n\nThe sleeping accommodation comprises three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a large principal bedroom. A well-appointed family bathroom. \n\nSitting Room 4.06m x 3.24m\nKitchen 4.06m x 4.23m\nSunroom 3.16m x 4.42m\nUtility 3.08m x 2.07m\nBathroom 3.03m x 2.07m\nBedroom 1 4.60m x 3.66m\nBedroom 2 2.85m x 3.67m\nBedroom 3 2.85m x 3.03m\n\nAccommodation Schedule - Apartment\nA valuable addition to the property is the detached one-bedroom apartment positioned separately from the main house.\n\nThe apartment comprises: open plan living room/kitchen, double bedroom, ensuite shower room, walk-in storage room and extends to 47 sq m\n\nThis versatile space is ideal for extended family accommodation, guests, home office use or potential supplementary income.\n\nLiving Room 4.21m x 4.24m\nKitchen 4.21m x 2.10m\nBedroom 2.84m x 4.57m\nEnsuite 1.27m x 2.71m\nWalk-in Storage 1.27m x 1.77m\n\nDetached Garage / Workshop\nTo the rear of the property stands a substantial detached garage/workshop measuring approximately 51.3 sq.m (5.80m x 8.84m).\n\nThis excellent space offers endless possibilities including: vehicle storage, workshop, tradesperson`s storage, home business use or hobby room. \n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
