        "Content": "Detached three-bedroom bungalow extending to c. 110 sqm\nSpacious and well-maintained family accommodation\nSeparate self-contained one-bedroom apartment c. 47 sq m\nideal for extended family, guests, home office use or additional income potential\nLarge detached garage/workshop c. 51 sq m\nOffering excellent storage, workspace and hobby opportunities\nMature private site with established trees, hedging, landscaped gardens and generous lawn areas\nSite extending to approximately c. 0.16 hectares (c.0.40 acres)\nPeaceful countryside location in Curraghtown, just minutes from Navan Town, the M3 motorway\nViewing Highly Recommended with T & J Gavigan"
      },
